 <h3><u>Izzat e mann</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Husain Husain...(4)<br> Ya zahra....<br> Ya Haider....</p> 
  <p>Shukriya fatema zahra<br> Shukriya Haider e qarraar<br> Aapne mujhko banaaya<br> Apne bete ka azadaar..(3)</p> 
  <p>Man misli.. mai azadar e Husain</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>1) Ye jo sharaf mujhko mila<br> aur kise rabb ne diya..(2)<br> Goondha gayaa mera khameer<br> usme mili khaak e shifaa..(2)<br> unse mujhe hai qalk kiyaa</p> 
  <p>Aab e baqaa, khaak e shifaa, zohd o sakhaa, Rab ki ataa</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>2) Khalq mujhe rabb ne kiya<br> sirf moharram ke liye..(2)<br> Aankh hai rone ke liye<br> haath hai maatam ke liye..(2)<br> Daulat e mann kya iske siwaa</p> 
  <p>Farsh e azaa, farsh e wilaa, ashq e azaa, karbobala</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>3) Seena hai kaaba e azaa<br> kaabe ka maulood Ali..(2)<br> Rabb ne jo meesaaq liya<br> dil me tha maujood Ali..(2)</p> 
  <p>Aur Karam mujhpar ye huwaa</p> 
  <p>Dil Jo diya, usme rakha, ishq e khuda, sheh ki azaa</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>4) Pehle waha wird kiya<br> sallu alaihi ya Husain..(2)<br> Ab ye wazeefa hai mera<br> sallu alaihi ya Husain..(2)</p> 
  <p>Kaam hai ye dunya me Mera</p> 
  <p>Nauha likha, nauha padha, nauha suna, kehta raha</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>5) Ishq e Ali mujhko mila<br> aur ghum e karbobala..(2)<br> Jab bhi uthey mere qadam<br> pohcha sar e farsh e aaza..(2)</p> 
  <p>Qaidi koi yaado'n me rahaa</p> 
  <p>Tauq e jafaa, me tha gala, kehta raha, Zain ul ebaa</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>6) Asr ka hangaam e sitam<br> bhool na paaunga kabhi..(2)<br> Reyt ke teeley pe khadi<br> ek behan roti rahi..(2)</p> 
  <p>Dekhi nahi phir aisi jafaa</p> 
  <p>Khushk gala, kat-ta raha, khoon baha, kehta huwa</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>7) Baad e shah e Karbobala<br> ahle haram qaidi bane..(2)<br> shaam talak aise gaye<br> ek rasan baara gale..(2)</p> 
  <p>Binte Ali thi mehwe bukaa</p> 
  <p>Lehje me tha Sher e khuda, mehwe buka, khutba diya</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>8) Hoti hai maula ki ataa<br> likhta hai Mazhar ka qalam..(2)<br> Mujhpey bhi Irfan e aza<br> hai ye shah e dee'n ka Karam..(2)</p> 
  <p>Naad e Ali jo mujhko milaa</p> 
  <p>Shukr e khuda, khoon mera, meri tarha, kehne lagaa</p> 
  <p>Risaalat e mann nabawi<br> Wilaayat e mann alawi<br> Qismat e mann fatemi<br> Sakhawat e mann Hasani</p> 
  <p>Izzat e mann Husaini<br> Ghairat e mann Abbasi</p> 
  <p>Husain... Husain... Ya zehra....</p> 
